@startuml
title Agents at work
' Where a person decides: the review and the release (<<decide>>).
' Follow a run live: omaspec preview agents.puml --follow agents.jsonl
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<decide>> #FFF1C2
  BorderColor<<decide>> #8B6508
}
[*] --> Planning
Planning --> Coding : plan ready
Coding --> Testing : pushed
Testing --> Coding : tests fail
Testing --> Review : tests pass
Review --> Coding : changes asked
Review --> Release : approved
Release --> [*] : shipped
Release --> Coding : held back
state Review <<decide>>
state Release <<decide>>
@enduml
